B.LF=A.a(s(["You cracked a field terminal. Those orders were classified for a reason, Doctor.","Collateral risk accepted. My signature. I know what I signed after Seven.","If you still walk into the Core, bring me something truer than a ghost story \u2014 or we end the same way."]),t.s)
